{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/da2f6f96cae703607a587d3a1bcaa7e2.webp?t=1771858872\" width=500 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come on down to Kill Cast! The show where the contestants have a chance to win... their lives!! You must blast, dodge and navigate your way through an endless onslaught of mutants! Don\u2019t worry, you will have access to dozens of weapons and power-ups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/47683884fcb8db99e2dd671fc61b9d81.poster.avif?t=1771858872\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/47683884fcb8db99e2dd671fc61b9d81.webm?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/47683884fcb8db99e2dd671fc61b9d81.mp4?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Host will always be serving up an endless array of trap filled rooms and hundreds of enemies who are determined on making sure you do not go home in one piece. The Host will do everything to make sure you don\u2019t leave the studio\u2026 alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/ef64754496008be95cf163203c40abbb.webp?t=1771858872\" width=500 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the next contestant of The Kill Cast Show, the rules are simple: Kill mutants, survive the rounds and cash out before you\u2019re cashed out. Each time you make it back to the studio you are given the chance to cash out and upload your high score or risk it all on another run! But be careful!! If you die, you lose it all!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/e39e8738b471736468b99a6d40f738b7.poster.avif?t=1771858872\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/e39e8738b471736468b99a6d40f738b7.webm?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/e39e8738b471736468b99a6d40f738b7.mp4?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of enemies will pour in from every direction, it is up to you to satisfy the crowd, meet the set kill count and move on to the next arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/6205f868a8c85496b18d7bd676e498ae.webp?t=1771858872\" width=500 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 20 arenas, and each one will test your dexterity and combat ability. Every encounter is different, and every run is different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/7ed600ee2fcd6ebf4ebf2095fccc2377.poster.avif?t=1771858872\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/7ed600ee2fcd6ebf4ebf2095fccc2377.webm?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/7ed600ee2fcd6ebf4ebf2095fccc2377.mp4?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons galore!! If you see something, grab it! You never know how it changes the outcome of the battle. Fight for the audience!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/55f1c0ddc0dd55ad9d2027396f6a69f0.poster.avif?t=1771858872\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/55f1c0ddc0dd55ad9d2027396f6a69f0.webm?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/55f1c0ddc0dd55ad9d2027396f6a69f0.mp4?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enough perseverance, maybe you can win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/a1a7497785b46c1081bb8ef4e05a896d.avif?t=1771858872\" width=500 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Cast is a fight till you die FPS game. Imagine this game being in an arcade setting; you play to get the highest score and that is it. There isn\u2019t any story, the world does not hold any secrets (or does it?), stats or inventory to manage. Just shoot and dodge. Since the game can go on as long as you\u2019re alive, each time you visit the studio, your status is saved and you can quit the game. When you return, you can pick up where you left off. However, if you die during a run, you lose your score, the only way to log your score to the leaderboards is to \u201cCash Out\u201d. Once you cash out, the game ends and you start a new run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the basic design of the game; you come in, play a loop or two and if you survive, save and come back and keep going. Try to get the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/9484fcc08b6e0be3919417c842b5da7c.avif?t=1771858872\" width=500 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way Kill Cast is set up we can expand levels, mutators, drops, enemy types and other gameplay things easily. The core of the game is complete, so as we work on the game past release there will be updates that enhance and modify the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re open to hear your ideas; \u00a0fancy mutators, another enemy type even traps, so please share them!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2940150?t=1771858872","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/8a57461374db51e6b413271910a9e6f2b440a802/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771858872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/9bbfadf1eefd19099b08a1215249f4de952d797d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771858872","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/9bbfadf1eefd19099b08a1215249f4de952d797d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771858872","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains harsh language that some users may take offense to. "},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4369510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/da2f6f96cae703607a587d3a1bcaa7e2.webp?t=1771858872\" width=500 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come on down to Kill Cast! The show where the contestants have a chance to win... their lives!! You must blast, dodge and navigate your way through an endless onslaught of mutants! Don\u2019t worry, you will have access to dozens of weapons and power-ups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/47683884fcb8db99e2dd671fc61b9d81.poster.avif?t=1771858872\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/47683884fcb8db99e2dd671fc61b9d81.webm?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/47683884fcb8db99e2dd671fc61b9d81.mp4?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Host will always be serving up an endless array of trap filled rooms and hundreds of enemies who are determined on making sure you do not go home in one piece. The Host will do everything to make sure you don\u2019t leave the studio\u2026 alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/ef64754496008be95cf163203c40abbb.webp?t=1771858872\" width=500 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the next contestant of The Kill Cast Show, the rules are simple: Kill mutants, survive the rounds and cash out before you\u2019re cashed out. Each time you make it back to the studio you are given the chance to cash out and upload your high score or risk it all on another run! But be careful!! If you die, you lose it all!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/e39e8738b471736468b99a6d40f738b7.poster.avif?t=1771858872\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/e39e8738b471736468b99a6d40f738b7.webm?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/e39e8738b471736468b99a6d40f738b7.mp4?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of enemies will pour in from every direction, it is up to you to satisfy the crowd, meet the set kill count and move on to the next arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/6205f868a8c85496b18d7bd676e498ae.webp?t=1771858872\" width=500 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 20 arenas, and each one will test your dexterity and combat ability. Every encounter is different, and every run is different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/7ed600ee2fcd6ebf4ebf2095fccc2377.poster.avif?t=1771858872\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/7ed600ee2fcd6ebf4ebf2095fccc2377.webm?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/7ed600ee2fcd6ebf4ebf2095fccc2377.mp4?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons galore!! If you see something, grab it! You never know how it changes the outcome of the battle. Fight for the audience!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/55f1c0ddc0dd55ad9d2027396f6a69f0.poster.avif?t=1771858872\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/55f1c0ddc0dd55ad9d2027396f6a69f0.webm?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/55f1c0ddc0dd55ad9d2027396f6a69f0.mp4?t=1771858872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enough perseverance, maybe you can win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/a1a7497785b46c1081bb8ef4e05a896d.avif?t=1771858872\" width=500 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Cast is a fight till you die FPS game. Imagine this game being in an arcade setting; you play to get the highest score and that is it. There isn\u2019t any story, the world does not hold any secrets (or does it?), stats or inventory to manage. Just shoot and dodge. Since the game can go on as long as you\u2019re alive, each time you visit the studio, your status is saved and you can quit the game. When you return, you can pick up where you left off. However, if you die during a run, you lose your score, the only way to log your score to the leaderboards is to \u201cCash Out\u201d. Once you cash out, the game ends and you start a new run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the basic design of the game; you come in, play a loop or two and if you survive, save and come back and keep going. Try to get the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/extras/9484fcc08b6e0be3919417c842b5da7c.avif?t=1771858872\" width=500 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way Kill Cast is set up we can expand levels, mutators, drops, enemy types and other gameplay things easily. The core of the game is complete, so as we work on the game past release there will be updates that enhance and modify the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re open to hear your ideas; \u00a0fancy mutators, another enemy type even traps, so please share them!</p>","developers":["CGBYLG","MonkeyMan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940150/371979d7cc68ba429e798ecee5d1568670aa44df/header.jpg?t=1771858872","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2940150/953229156/457b73296d26049570949432abf4ca0cdcce2bd4/1761128129/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762482197","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2940150/953229156/457b73296d26049570949432abf4ca0cdcce2bd4/1761128129/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762482197","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2940150/953229156/457b73296d26049570949432abf4ca0cdcce2bd4/1761128129/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762482197","id":257220963,"name":"Kill Cast Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.s